           05  FILLER                    PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  DL1-CODE                  PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(6)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  DL1-DLY-REQ               PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  DL1-INVENTORY             PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  DL1-UM                    PIC XX.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(4)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  DL1-DAYS-OH               PIC ZZZ,ZZZ.99.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  DL1-ON-ORDER              PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
