           05  DL1-INV-VALUE             PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZZ.99.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(5)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  DL1-ACCT-DAYS             PIC ZZZ,ZZZ.99.

       01  DETAIL-LINE2.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(18)  VALUE SPACES.
