           05  CL1-ACCT-DAYS             PIC ZZZ,ZZZ.99.

       01  CLASS-LINE2.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(74)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  CL2-24HR-USAGE            PIC ---,---,--9.
