           05  GL1-INVENTORY             PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  GL1-UM                    PIC XX.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(4)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  GL1-DAYS-OH               PIC ZZZ,ZZZ.99.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  GL1-ON-ORDER              PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(22)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  GL1-INV-VALUE             PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZZ.99.
